{"id": "sdqa0003", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Grasshoppers eat plants. They mainly feed on leaves, grass, and other types of vegetation. Some grasshoppers might also nibble on small stems or flowers, depending on the species.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0011", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Earth's atmosphere is made up of about 21% oxygen.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0019", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The last Han dynasty em peror was Liu Xiu, also known as Emperor Guang wu of Han. He re established the Han Dynasty after the fall of the Western Han and ruled until his death in 57 AD. His reign marked the end of the Han Dynasty as a major power before it eventually declined and fell to the Wei state, which began the Three Kingdoms period.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
