{"id": "sdqa0051", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The San je Gandhi National Park is located in the state of Mad hya Pradesh, India. It' s situated near the town of Kanha and covers a large forested area known for its rich biodiversity, especially as a habitat for Asiatic lions and other wildlife.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
