{"id": "sdqa0075", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Karaganda administrative region is located in Kazakhstan, in the central part of the country. It' s situated near the Irtysh River and forms a significant area known for its industrial development and as the site of important mining activities.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
