{"id": "sdqa0107", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The dominant language in Pristina is Al banian. It is the official language of Kosovo and spoken by the majority of people there.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0115", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Roman Republic was formed in 50 9 BC. It began as a transformation from the earlier Roman kingdom, which had fallen into dis order. The people revolt ed against the ruling elite, leading to the establishment of a new system with elected officials and representative institutions. This marked the beginning of the Roman Republic, lasting until it was replaced by the Roman Empire in 27 BC.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0123", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The British Empire ended gradually over the 20th century. Its final decline really began in the mid-1 9 40s, especially after World War I I, when many former colonies gained independence. By the 19 60 s and 1 9 70s, most of its major territories had become independent nation s. So while there was no single exact date, you could say it effectively ended by the late 20th century.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0131", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I-75 runs from the Canadian border in Michigan all the way down to Florida. It is one of the longest inter state highways in the United States, spanning over 1, 9 00 miles through eight different states.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0139", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first sex change operation was performed in Germany.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0147", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Saxony is a state in Germany located in the eastern part of the country. It is known for its rich history, cultural heritage, and beautiful landscape, including forest s, mountain ranges like the Ore Mountains, and historic cities such as Dresden and Chemnitz. The region played an important role in both medieval and modern German history.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0155", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Flanders is located in the northern part of Belgium, covering roughly two- thirds of the country. It' s a region known for its rich history, culture, and language— Dutch, which is spoken there, though many also speak French and English. The area includes major cities like Antwer p, Ghent, Brug ges, and O stend. It has a mix of flat lowlands and historic town s, making it both culturally significant and touristic ally vibrant.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0163", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first executive producer of East Enders was Eric More no. He played a key role in bringing the show to life when it launched on BBC One in 198 5.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0171", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first opera was written by Jac obus de Ha ydn in 159 7. It was called Daf ne and marked the beginning of the opera form, which combines singing, acting, and music.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0179", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Dialectics is a philosophical concept that traces its roots back to ancient Greek thought, particularly through the works of Hi ppocrates and later developed by philosophers like Heraclitus and Plato. It refers to the method of reasoning based on dialogue, where opposing views are presented and examined to reach a deeper understanding or truth. The term gained significant prominence in modern times with the work of German philosopher Georg Wilhelm Friedrich He gel, who used dialect ics to explain how ideas evolve through conflict and resolution.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
